# graphify: union-merge driver for graph.json, avoids manual JSON conflict
# resolution on a file that's often thousands of lines. Requires the
# corresponding [merge "graphify-union"] section in each clone's local
# .git/config (git merge drivers are never versioned) — see
# my-config/memory/reference_graphify.md for the exact snippet.
graphify-out/graph.json merge=graphify-union
